            Show quest "And in the meantime, please collect the next item. [First-Class Canine] from [Iron Claws]. It's very precious and tough to get it.  Good luck.\n\nAppraisers of Goods Eslant updated Deeds in accordance with the request of the [Iron Claw] from [canine sangdeunggeup] must come sujiphae."

