On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "That was fast. I'm not even through with the previous appraisal yet.\n\nWell, we still have a lot of time left.  In the meantime, let's collect the next item. I need [Thick Half Troll Leather] from [Half Troll Captain]. It's the toughest of all leather. This time, take your time."
